## Auto-Save Behavior

When creating analysis files:
1. Save to `docs/openclaw-research/` automatically
2. Use numbered prefixes (01-, 02-, etc.) for ordering
3. Use descriptive filenames (memory-system, heartbeat-logic, etc.)
4. Create IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md last (after all analysis is complete)

